@guide H_Felwood
@name Felwood (Bloodvenom Post)
@faction Horde
@levels 51-54
@zone Felwood
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Bloodvenom Post, the corrupted moonwells, Jaedenar, Shatter Scar Vale and the Timbermaw furbolgs.
@next H_WesternPlaguelands

fp Bloodvenom Post
accept Well of Corruption | Winna Hazzard, Bloodvenom Post.
accept Corrupted Sabers
accept Cleansing Felwood | Maybess Riverbreeze, Emerald Sanctuary.
accept Forces of Jaedenar | Greta Mosshoof, Emerald Sanctuary.
accept Verifying the Corruption | Taronn Redfeather.
accept Wild Guardians [optional] | Trull Failbane.
complete Well of Corruption | Fill the flask at the Irontree moonwell.
complete Corrupted Sabers | Use the cage on a corrupted saber.
complete Forces of Jaedenar | Jaedenar cultists.
complete Verifying the Corruption | Explore north of Shatter Scar Vale.
turnin Well of Corruption
turnin Corrupted Sabers
turnin Forces of Jaedenar
accept Collection of the Corrupt Water
complete Collection of the Corrupt Water | The corrupted moonwell in Jaedenar.
turnin Collection of the Corrupt Water
turnin Verifying the Corruption
complete Cleansing Felwood
turnin Cleansing Felwood
accept Timbermaw Ally | Grazle, near the Timbermaw Hold tunnel.
accept Deadwood of the North | Nafien.
complete Deadwood of the North | Deadwood furbolgs.
turnin Deadwood of the North
turnin Timbermaw Ally
level 54
train
note Fly to the Undercity and ride east to the Bulwark (Tirisfal/Western Plaguelands border).
